      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present the case of an 88-year-old patient who underwent off-pump coronary artery bypass using an aortic connector followed by repair of an abdominal aortic aneurysm to reduce surgical invasiveness. This approach merits consideration for high-risk patients."},
